			"notes": "---\n\n# Cell⁴ 1.0.2 Changelog\n\n- Added Cell Preview: tooltip shows matched item icons using AE2's rendering (up to 18 items)\n- Added Cell Configurator: creative-mode tool with in-game UI for editing cell NBT\n- Added Creative Tab Presets: pre-configured Logs Tag Cell, Minecraft ModID Cell, Water Tag Cell\n\n---\n\n# Cell⁴ 1.0.2 更新日志\n\n- 新增元件预览：工具提示使用AE2渲染显示匹配的物品图标（最多18个）\n- 新增元件配置器：创造模式工具，可在游戏内编辑元件NBT\n- 新增创造模式标签页预设：预配置的原木标签元件、Minecraft模组元件、水标签元件\n\n---\n<img width=\"508\" height=\"341\" alt=\"1b49fd40-237d-4f4f-b71b-9770ecedd423\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c0d7481-40c4-42bd-a218-5fc8a80e4191\" />\n<img width=\"509\" height=\"341\" alt=\"7a75df9f-38c5-4534-b89a-b8f1b66d2313\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/965b59f2-d911-4bce-a878-43098599b7df\" />\n<img width=\"508\" height=\"341\" alt=\"fba9fbfc-47f5-462d-b976-4ef1a245ba85\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b43c7aad-b41f-4d65-8a97-c800518a024a\" />"
